{"name": "Seagulls: Crappy Situation", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"547\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/9a22f439c5606e3d1162624865d6582c.avif?t=1781986714\" width=\"1358\"/></span>You\u2019re stranded on a barely-floating raft in a chaotic solo or local co-op action rogue-lite. Shoot deranged seagulls, scrub the deck, dive for scrap, patch the damage, and buy questionable upgrades before the next wave ruins everything. <br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"154\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/5095d1b85da302a33e0757b112bdb00f.poster.avif?t=1781986714\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/5095d1b85da302a33e0757b112bdb00f.webm?t=1781986714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/5095d1b85da302a33e0757b112bdb00f.mp4?t=1781986714\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><strong>No Country for Clean Decks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seagull Problems Require Seagull Solutions.\u00a0Defend your raft against constant waves of deranged seagulls. Shoot them down with your slingshot before they cover your raft in seagull souvenirs.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"154\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/707f95556d47a0049d6bc19eec9563f7.poster.avif?t=1781986714\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/707f95556d47a0049d6bc19eec9563f7.webm?t=1781986714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/707f95556d47a0049d6bc19eec9563f7.mp4?t=1781986714\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><strong>Bring a Friend, Blame a Friend</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play solo or drag a friend into local split-screen co-op<strong>.</strong> When the raft sinks, remember: it was probably <strong>their fault.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"154\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/1ee5be60674f1b24771b1311cea09475.poster.avif?t=1781986714\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/1ee5be60674f1b24771b1311cea09475.webm?t=1781986714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/1ee5be60674f1b24771b1311cea09475.mp4?t=1781986714\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span>\u267e\ufe0f<strong>\u00a0One More Run</strong><br/>Experiment with upgrades and survive as long as possible while the seagulls return faster, angrier, and legally banned from every beach.   <br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"330\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/b99d4d264c1ea6be55e44cf41fd269e3.poster.avif?t=1781986714\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/b99d4d264c1ea6be55e44cf41fd269e3.webm?t=1781986714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/b99d4d264c1ea6be55e44cf41fd269e3.mp4?t=1781986714\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><strong>Aim, Shoot, Upgrade Your Raft</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clean under pressure, repair on the fly, and survive bird attacks in a chaotic battle bonanza.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"154\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/ff7c2d7d2155b94243b7938c3a1939d9.poster.avif?t=1781986714\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/ff7c2d7d2155b94243b7938c3a1939d9.webm?t=1781986714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/ff7c2d7d2155b94243b7938c3a1939d9.mp4?t=1781986714\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span> <strong>Hose Before Bros</strong> <br/>Spray first, panic later. Hose down the mess, fight off the birds, and keep your raft floating. The next wave is already on its way.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"154\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/9fde057d8db9f22b6bed2a280097ba2f.poster.avif?t=1781986714\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/9fde057d8db9f22b6bed2a280097ba2f.webm?t=1781986714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/9fde057d8db9f22b6bed2a280097ba2f.mp4?t=1781986714\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span> <strong>Fishy Business</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scrap happens! Dive for parts and turn wreckage into raft reinforcements, upgrades, and other questionable advantages.  <br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"154\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/3c7cdf5a92e9ddfddbd25bbeb68dea26.poster.avif?t=1781986714\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/3c7cdf5a92e9ddfddbd25bbeb68dea26.webm?t=1781986714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/3c7cdf5a92e9ddfddbd25bbeb68dea26.mp4?t=1781986714\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><i><strong> </strong></i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"228\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/extras/f64a578cb2c5010a6e9b32f2b464cfe9.avif?t=1781986714\" width=\"600\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>No seagulls were hurt during this production.\u00a0P.S:\u00a0</i></strong>Winner of the prestigious \u201cKing of Bugs\u201d award. Even the bugs are just trying to survive.  </p> </div>", "short_desc": "Defend a barely-floating raft in a chaotic solo or local co-op action rogue-lite. Shoot deranged seagulls, scrub the deck, dive for scrap, patch the damage, and buy questionable upgrades before the next wave ruins everything.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843720/header.jpg?t=1781986714", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Shooter", "Third-Person Shooter", "Action", "Survival", "Tower Defense", "Base Building"], "developers": "Nine Lives Game Studio", "publishers": "Nine Lives Game Studio", "release_date": "2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "2843720", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "10 February 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/TaGumXwLQ1I", "first_seen": 1739142000.0, "review_rank": 1852}